WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.778 --> 00:00:09.258
I am a baby elephant.

2
00:00:10.138 --> 00:00:13.659
When I was only three days old, I began to walk.

3
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.401
I like to eat all kinds of plants.

4
00:00:19.301 --> 00:00:21.641
I like to eat fruit and bark too.

5
00:00:22.402 --> 00:00:24.282
But I do not eat meat.

6
00:00:26.283 --> 00:00:27.943
Let me show you how I eat.

7
00:00:28.743 --> 00:00:31.104
I use my long trunk to pick up food.

8
00:00:32.976 --> 00:00:35.879
I use my trunk to breathe and smell too.

9
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.162
I use my trunk to spray water on my body.

10
00:00:41.143 --> 00:00:43.185
I can take a bath using my trunk!

11
00:00:43.665 --> 00:00:48.809
Splash! I use my trunk to throw dust all over my body.

12
00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:50.691
Doesn't it look fun?

13
00:00:51.791 --> 00:00:54.133
There is another kind of bath I like too.

14
00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:58.037
I like to take a mud bath.

15
00:00:58.817 --> 00:01:00.479
Rolling in the mud is fun!

16
00:01:03.256 --> 00:01:03.636
Whee! Oh!

17
00:01:04.277 --> 00:01:05.978
It is so hot today.

18
00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:09.820
I can flap my large ears to cool off my body.

19
00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:15.603
Ahh! I also flap my ears to chase the flies away.

20
00:01:16.083 --> 00:01:22.907
Shoo! I can do so many things with my ears and trunk!

21
00:01:23.948 --> 00:01:26.329
But there is one thing I cannot do.

22
00:01:27.009 --> 00:01:31.812
Jump! The elephant is the only mammal that cannot jump.

23
00:01:32.728 --> 00:01:33.648
But that's okay.

24
00:01:34.529 --> 00:01:36.270
I can walk faster than people!

25
00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.191
Do you see my dad?

26
00:01:40.011 --> 00:01:41.892
He has something I don't have yet.

27
00:01:42.672 --> 00:01:43.993
Look at his tusks!

28
00:01:45.794 --> 00:01:48.635
I wish I had huge tusks like my dad.

29
00:01:49.515 --> 00:01:50.936
I think they look wonderful.

30
00:01:52.477 --> 00:01:56.558
Dad says that someday I will have huge tusks too.

31
00:01:57.619 --> 00:01:58.739
But I will have to wait.

32
00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:02.661
When I grow up, I will look just like him!
